# Sales Performance Dashboard – 2014

## Project Overview

The **Sales Performance Dashboard – 2014** is an interactive Excel dashboard designed to provide a consolidated view of sales performance across salespeople, products, sales ranges, and time periods.

The dashboard transforms transactional sales data into an easy-to-understand visual report, allowing users to quickly identify sales contributions, product performance, and changes across selected periods.

## Dashboard Objectives

The main objectives of this project were to:

* Monitor overall sales performance.
* Analyze sales contribution by salesperson.
* Track sales trends over time.
* Identify the highest-performing products.
* Segment sales based on predefined sales ranges.
* Provide interactive filtering by salesperson and order date.
* Present key sales metrics in a single management-oriented dashboard.

