## Business Insights

The dashboard demonstrates how raw sales data can be converted into actionable business information. Sales managers can use this type of report to monitor salesperson contribution, evaluate product-level performance, identify monthly sales patterns, and investigate specific segments through interactive filters.

The current dashboard view shows total sales of **₹3,030**, with **Beer contributing ₹2,016** and **Fruit Cocktail contributing ₹1,014**. This provides a quick product-level comparison while the salesperson and date filters allow the analysis to be narrowed to specific business segments.

